ir best as elements of word-images. When Cambria is used for captions at sizes over 20 point, the  inter-character spacing should be slightly reduced for best results. The design isn't just intended for business documents: The regular weight has been extended with a large set of math and science symbols. The Greek and Cyrillic has been designed under close supervision of an international team of experts, who aimed to set a historical new standard in multi-script type design.http://www.microsoft.com/typography/ctfontshttp://www.fonts.comYou may use this font as permitted by the EULA for the product in which this font is included to display and print content. You may only (i) embed this font in content as permitted by the embedding restrictions included in this font; and (ii) temporarily download this font to a printer or other output device to help print content.http://www.microsoft.com/typography/fonts/default.aspx␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿƒ␀t␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¹␀ þ´	J ¸ú´	J ¸ù´	J ¸ø´	J ¸÷´	J ¸ö´	J ¸ð´	J ¸ï´	J ¸î´	J ¸í´	J ¸ì´	J ¸ë´	J ¸æ´	J ¸å´	J ¸ä´	J ¸ã´	J ¸â´	J ¸á´	J ¸à´	J ¸Ó´	J ¸Ò´	J ¸Ñ´	J ¸Ï´	J ¸Î´	J ¸Í´	J ¸Ì´	J ¸ ´	J ¸´	J ¸Ž´	J ¸Š´	J ¸ˆ´	J ¸‡´	J ¸†´	J ¸[´	J ¸Z´	J ¸Y´	J ¸X´	J ¸T´	J ¸P´	J ¸L´	J ¸K´	J ¸J´	J ¸6´	J ¸0´	J ¸/´	J ¸-´	J ¸,´	J ¸	´	J ¸´	J ¸@ÿ	J ô	J ò	J ñ	J ð	J ï	J í	J ì	J ê	J å	J ä	J ã	J á	J Þ	J Ú	J Ø	J Ó	J Í	J Ì	J Ê	J É	J È	J Æ	J Ä	J Â	J À	J ¿	J ½	J ³	J ±	J ¯	J ¥	J ¤	J  	J Ž	J 	J Œ	J ‹	J Š	J ‰	J …	J „	J ƒ	@>J €	J 	J ~	J }	J b	J Q	J P	J H	J B	J 	JAcA␀A␀/A␀?A␀OA␀_A␀oA␀A␀A␀ŸA␀¯A␀¿A␀ÏA␀␀_ê␀␀€ô␀ô␀ ô␀°ô␀Àô␀Ðô␀àô␀ðô␀␀/3␀?3␀O3␀_3␀o3␀3␀3␀Ÿ3␀¯3␀¿3␀
